  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO support to MENA Complex Emergency - Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funds will support the Egyptian Red Crescent Society (ERCS), in coordination with IFRC, to immediately upscale the supply of humanitarian aid into Gaza in the wake of the recent cease fire on 10 October 2025. The funds will contribute to the supply chain activities of the IFRC MENA Crisis Emergency Appeal including for Warehouse rental, Transportation, ERCS staff and volunteers, and IFRC Support staff.</narrative>
  </description>
